        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Physical growth and development:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " oral health (regular visits with dentist, daily brushing and flossing, adequate fluoride, limits on sugar-sweetened beverages and snacks), nutrition (healthy weight; increased vegetable, fruit, whole-grain consumption; adequate calcium and vitamin D intake; healthy foods at school), physical activity (60 minutes of physical activity a day)."
     }
    ]
